{"code":"zh-Hans","nativeName":"简体中文","entries":[{"key":"imagePickup.popup.rejected.title","value":"共享图片已被拒绝"},{"key":"imagePickup.popup.limit.title","value":"共享图片数量上限"},{"key":"imagePickup.popup.batchNotice.title","value":"图片批次提示"},{"key":"imagePickup.popup.animatedBatch.title","value":"动态图片批次"},{"key":"imagePickup.popup.accept","value":"确定"},{"key":"imagePickup.popup.unknownFile","value":"未知文件"},{"key":"imagePickup.popup.defaultReason","value":"无法导入图片。"},{"key":"imagePickup.popup.rejection.description","value":"<b>文件：</b>{0}\n\n图片未被导入。请修正下方所述问题后重试。\n\n<b>原因：</b>{1}"},{"key":"imagePickup.popup.limit.summary","value":"同时最多可以拥有 <b>{0}</b> 张共享图片。仍在解码的图片也会计入此上限。\n\n你当前有 <b>{1}</b> 张活动或等待处理的图片。 "},{"key":"imagePickup.popup.limit.allowedSome","value":"所选 <b>{1}</b> 张图片中仅允许了 <b>{0}</b> 张，其余图片已被阻止。"},{"key":"imagePickup.popup.limit.noneImported","value":"没有导入其他图片。"},{"key":"imagePickup.popup.animated.warning","value":"此批次包含 <b>{0}</b> 张动态图片。静态海报会先显示，但为了避免传输中断，动画数据会逐张发送。较大的动态图片批次可能需要明显更长的时间才能与其他用户完成同步。"},{"key":"imagePickup.popup.reason.adminLocked","value":"管理员已在此服务器上锁定共享图片。"},{"key":"imagePickup.popup.reason.animationStartFailed","value":"无法开始处理动态图片：{0}"},{"key":"imagePickup.popup.reason.adminLockedDuringDecode","value":"GIF 解码期间，管理员锁定了共享图片。"}]}
